      <article class="rcard"><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5">★★★★★</div><p>The slim fit denim sits perfectly and the stretch is comfortable all day. Fabric quality feels much better than the price suggests.</p><div class="rwho"><span class="av">R</span><div><b>Rafiq Ahmed</b><small>Verified buyer · Dhaka</small></div></div></article>
      <article class="rcard"><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5">★★★★★</div><p>Ordered on Sunday and it arrived in two days. Paid cash on delivery and the packaging was neat.</p><div class="rwho"><span class="av">T</span><div><b>Tanvir Hasan</b><small>Verified buyer · Chattogram</small></div></div></article>
      <article class="rcard"><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5">★★★★★</div><p>Bought a few pieces for my son. The kids’ fabric is soft and the sizing was accurate. Will order again.</p><div class="rwho"><span class="av">S</span><div><b>Sadia Rahman</b><small>Verified buyer · Sylhet</small></div></div></article>
      <article class="rcard"><div class="stars" aria-label="4 out of 5">★★★★☆</div><p>The belt and wallet combo looks premium and makes a great gift. Exchange was easy when I needed a different size.</p><div class="rwho"><span class="av">I</span><div><b>Imran Hossain</b><small>Verified buyer · Khulna</small></div></div></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

